OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,6,     F2/5. Donald Macleod surveys
OL,7,     FRameau's new career as a composer
OL,8,     Ffor the stage, at a time when
OL,9,     FRameau had not long turned fifty
OL,10,     Fyears old.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FGuitarists Marta Pereira da Costa
OL,13,     Fand Joao Pita Junior. Chris Butler
OL,14,     Fand Erik Bosgraaf on the London
OL,15,     FInternational Festival of Early
OL,16,     FMusic.
